<body>
    
    <p><span>Tadem questions:</span></p><p><span>Why are you a good fit for this role?</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>Talk us through what you've been working on recently</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>What about startups excite you?</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>Harmonic:</span></p><p><span>Why are you a good fit for this role?</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>What are you passionate about? (Can be non-work related)</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>Sieve questions:</span></p><p><span>What are you a good fit for this role?</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>What are you looking for in your next job? How do you prioritize between the different things you're looking for?&nbsp;(optional)</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>What's the most technically challenging problem you've solved before?&nbsp;(optional)</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>Describe the workplace that was the most difficult from an interpersonal standpoint. Inversely, describe the team/workplace that you enjoyed the most. What elements made each experience enjoyable or challenging for you?&nbsp;(optional)</span></p>

</body>
</html>